      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ERUPT (3) has some solid form under her belt and proved too strong last time to win by one length at this track in a handy 29.75 beating Jet Boots Tommy. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and five minor placings to her credit. Has hit winning form and can go on with it. TARAWI MALIBU (1) was safely held in tougher company last start at this track, but prior to that won by 1.3 lengths at The Gardens (29.90) beating Jimmy Figgis in a Grade 5 on October 17. Cannot be taken lightly. SOUL PANORAMIC (4) spotted a start but wound up strongly to place when 8 lengths third (36.53) at Richmond in Grade 5. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Leading chance. WONKY KEY DONKEY (8) will be thereabouts after recent top-three finishes.",
